  "hh_ethnologue_comment": {
    "comment": "Butam is a language related to Taulil [tuh] once spoken in New Britain (**hh:s:Laufer:Butam**, **hh:hv:Stebbins:EBismarcks**, **hh:ld:Capell:Butam**, **hh:h:Filer:Lost**). It has been pronounced extinct but this remains to be verified on the ground. It is missing from E16/E17/E18/E19/E20/E21/E22/E23/E24/E25/E26/E27/E28/E29. See also: Taulil [tuh].",
